  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"article-table\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr style=\"font-size:18px;\">\n<th>Template documentation follows\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i>Note: the template above may sometimes be partially or fully invisible.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Visit <a href=\"/wiki/Template:Country_data_United_States_Navy/doc\" title=\"Template:Country data United States Navy/doc\">Template:Country_data_United_States_Navy/doc</a> to edit this documentation. (<a href=\"/wiki/Template:Documentation\" title=\"Template:Documentation\">How does this work?</a>)\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div style=\"margin:0 1em;\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_flag_variants\">List of flag variants</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Year</th>\n<th>Flag image (40px)</th>\n<th>Number</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1794</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_13_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 13 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 13 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 13 stars. Used by the U.S. Navy from March 27, 1794 to May 1, 1795.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1795</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_15_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 15 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 15 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 15 stars. Used from May 1, 1795 to July 3, 1818.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1818</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_20_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 20 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 20 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 20 stars. Used from July 4, 1818 to July 3, 1819.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1819</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_21_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 21 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 21 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 21 stars. Used from July 4, 1819 to July 3, 1820.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1820</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_23_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 23 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 23 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 23 stars. Used from July 4, 1820 to July 3, 1822.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1822</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_24_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 24 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 24 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 24 stars. Used from July 4, 1822 to July 3, 1836.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1836</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_25_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 25 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 25 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 25 stars. Used from July 4, 1836 to July 3, 1837.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1837</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_26_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 26 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 26 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 26 stars. Used from July 4, 1837 to July 3, 1845.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1845</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_27_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 27 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 27 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 27 stars. Used from July 4, 1845 to July 3, 1846.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1846</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_28_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 28 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 28 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 28 stars. Used from July 4, 1846 to July 3, 1847.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1847</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_29_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 29 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 29 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 29 stars. Used from July 4, 1847 to July 3, 1848.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1848</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_30_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 30 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 30 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 30 stars. Used from July 4, 1848 to July 3, 1851.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1851</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_31_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 31 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 31 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 31 stars. Used from July 4, 1851 to July 3, 1858.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1858</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_32_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 32 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 32 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 32 stars. Used from July 4, 1858 to July 3, 1859.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1859</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_33_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 33 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 33 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 33 stars. Used from July 4, 1859 to July 3, 1861.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1861</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_34_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 34 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 34 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 34 stars. Used from July 4, 1861 to July 3, 1863.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1863</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_35_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 35 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 35 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>17</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 35 stars. Used from July 4, 1863 to July 3, 1865.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1864</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=USNavyInfantryBattalionFlag.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:USNavyInfantryBattalionFlag.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:USNavyInfantryBattalionFlag.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>18</td>\n<td><i>De facto</i> flag of the U.S. Navy from 1864 to 1959. Please use this flag to represent the U.S. Navy from December 9, 1864 to April 24, 1959 in articles pertaining to it within this time period.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1865</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_36_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 36 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 36 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 36 stars. Used from July 4, 1865 to July 3, 1867.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1867</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_37_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 37 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 37 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 37 stars. Used from July 4, 1867 to July 3, 1877.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1877</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_38_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 38 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 38 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>21</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 38 stars. Used from July 4, 1877 to July 3, 1890.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1879</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Seal_of_the_United_States_Department_of_the_Navy_(1879-1957).png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Seal of the United States Department of the Navy (1879-1957).png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"42\">File:Seal of the United States Department of the Navy (1879-1957).png</span></a></span></td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td>Seal of the United States Department of the Navy from 1879 to 1957.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1890</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_43_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 43 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 43 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>23</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 43 stars. Used from July 4, 1890 to July 3, 1891.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1891</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_44_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 44 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 44 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 44 stars. Used from July 4, 1891 to July 3, 1896.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1896</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_45_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 45 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 45 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>25</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 45 stars. Used from July 4, 1896 to July 3, 1908.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1908</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_46_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 46 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 46 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>26</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 46 stars. Used from July 4, 1908 to July 3, 1912.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1912</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_48_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 48 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 48 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>27</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 48 stars. Used from July 4, 1912 to July 3, 1959.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1957</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Seal_of_the_United_States_Department_of_the_Navy.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Seal of the United States Department of the Navy.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"42\">File:Seal of the United States Department of the Navy.svg</span></a></span></td>\n<td>28</td>\n<td>Seal of the United States Department of the Navy from 1957 to the present day.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1959<br /><small>(default)</small></td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/e/e9/Flag_of_the_United_States_Navy.svg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20150901161132\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Flag of the United States Navy.svg\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_the_United_States_Navy.svg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span></span></td>\n<td>29</td>\n<td>The current <i>de jure</i> flag of the U.S. Navy, adopted on April 24, 1959. Please use this flag to represent the U.S. Navy from April 24, 1959 to the present day in articles that pertain to this time period.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1959</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack_49_stars.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack 49 stars.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack 49 stars.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 49 stars. Used from July 4, 1959 to July 3, 1960.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1960</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>31</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 50 stars. Adopted on July 4, 1960.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1975</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Naval_Jack_of_the_United_States.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Naval Jack of the United States.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:Naval Jack of the United States.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 13 stripes. Used from October 13, 1975 to December 31, 1976.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1977</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=US_Naval_Jack.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:US Naval Jack.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:US Naval Jack.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>33</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 50 stars. Re-adopted on January 1, 1977.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2002</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Naval_Jack_of_the_United_States.svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Naval Jack of the United States.svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"40\">File:Naval Jack of the United States.svg</span></a></span></span></td>\n<td>34</td>\n<td>Naval jack with 13 stripes. Used since 2002 to the present day.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205533\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1]\nCPU time usage: 0.081 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.118 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2600/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29307/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2845/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 11/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   19.406      1 Template:Country_showdata\n100.00%   19.406      1 -total\n 85.98%   16.686      1 Template:Documentation\n 80.32%   15.587      1 Template:Country_data_United_States